'''Sorrowmore Lake''' is a lake in central [[Balor]] that is inhabited by [[crocolisk]]s.

There is an abandoned inn by the lake that is occupied by members of the [[Stormreaver clan]] led by [[Jailor Bloodhand]], who are holding [[SI:7]] [[Agent Deryl]] captive.

